<p>An editor-authored purple Note panel renders once, from its node:</p><ac:adf-extension><ac:adf-node type="panel"><ac:adf-attribute key="panel-type">note</ac:adf-attribute><ac:adf-attribute key="local-id">54e36e4937ac</ac:adf-attribute><ac:adf-content><p local-id="8bd8974da4e1"><strong>Notes / open questions</strong></p><ul local-id="c50ad869cce2"><li><p>An <em>emphasised</em> item with <code>code</code>.</p></li><li><p>A second item.</p></li></ul></ac:adf-content></ac:adf-node><ac:adf-fallback><div class="panel conf-macro output-block" style="background-color: rgb(234,230,255);border-color: rgb(153,141,217);border-width: 1.0px;"><div class="panelContent" style="background-color: rgb(234,230,255);">
<p local-id="8bd8974da4e1"><strong>Notes / open questions</strong></p><ul local-id="c50ad869cce2"><li><p>An <em>emphasised</em> item with <code>code</code>.</p></li><li><p>A second item.</p></li></ul>
</div></div></ac:adf-fallback></ac:adf-extension><p>An extension of some other type passes through the same way:</p><ac:adf-extension><ac:adf-node type="expand"><ac:adf-attribute key="title">Details</ac:adf-attribute><ac:adf-content><p>Hidden <strong>body</strong>.</p></ac:adf-content></ac:adf-node><ac:adf-fallback><div class="expand-container"><p>Hidden <strong>body</strong>.</p></div></ac:adf-fallback></ac:adf-extension><p>An extension with a fallback and no node keeps the fallback, its only copy:</p><ac:adf-extension><ac:adf-fallback><div class="panel"><p>Only copy.</p></div></ac:adf-fallback></ac:adf-extension>
